  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/286e928a8b3f63004b6cfbd59014dec95e814727.png\" alt=\"标题\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">本模组将新增一种装饰方块变体，<br>名为百叶窗，用于美化您的窗户。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">该方块融合了活板门与门的特性，<br>放置后仅占据一个方块的体积，&nbsp;<br>但您可以在其下方或上方放置其他方块，<br>它们会自动连接！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">百叶窗共有三种状态：<br>关闭、半开和全开。 <br>若百叶窗侧面有方块阻挡，<br>则只能打开至半开状态。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">本模组支持多个其他模组，例如：Nature's Spirit、Supplementaries、Quark、Ecologics 和 Create&nbsp;<br>此外还兼容：Environmental、Outer End、Snowy Spirit、Autumnity、Endergetic、GoodEnding</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/nudelauflauch/shutter/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/759/188/github.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/goiler-weapony\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0f4a44ddb3c7ac96014ace083e8dd1d54690c3de.png\" alt=\"link_goiler_weaponry\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cheesus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d34cce909ba69bcded083d80b707c88b30ee46c6.png\" alt=\"link_cheesus\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash; ▲▲ &nbsp;我们的其他模组 &nbsp;▲▲ &ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>未经明确授权，严禁分发本作品</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
